  "short": "Boise, on Grove. A shop with a pintxo counter and paella cooked outside twice a week.",
  "today": "Paella Wednesdays and Fridays at noon, first Thursdays at 6. Walk up, order, eat on the patio or carry it off. Pintxo Hour keeps the door open to 6 on Thursday, Friday and Saturday.",
  "note": "It is a market that feeds people, not a dining room. Two people can eat here without sitting down."
